# Generated clustering artifacts — large; keep the uncompressed copies out of git.
#
# These are only regenerable from container.tsv, which is itself only
# regenerable from a populated works database (see ../get_view.php). So the end
# product of the pipeline, container_docs.json, is NOT safely reproducible once
# the database is wiped or rebuilt from different sources -- a gzipped copy is
# committed alongside as container_docs.json.gz, and that is the file to reload
# from (clustering/couch_push.php) when seeding a new database.
containers.db
containers.db-shm
containers.db-wal
clusters.tsv
clusters_multi.tsv
clusters_multi.html
container_docs.json
